(root/"output/grid/report.html").write_text('<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Ip Rasm grid crafts</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;margin:24px;background:#faf8ef;color:#18201d;max-width:1100px}img{max-width:100%;height:auto;image-rendering:pixelated;width:384px}section{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}a{color:#235544}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}p{max-width:85ch}article{max-width:100%}</style><h1>Working local mosaic and diamond guides</h1><p>Open the website and choose Grid crafts (UZ: Mozaika; RU: Мозаика). Actual JPEG/PNG photos are processed locally and assigned to the entered palette with finite inventory and reserved spare pieces. Original source aspect is preserved by fitting onto white; there is no photographic result overlay. Example7-gray/12-color palettes are provisional; they are not claims about supplied kits, exact commercial color matching or physical acceptance.</p><section><article><h2>Actual48x64 mosaic</h2><img src="mosaic-48x64.png" alt="3072 actual mosaic elements"><p>3072 pieces; 8mm pitch gives384x512mm. <a href="mosaic-48x64.json">Exact local project</a>.</p></article><article><h2>Actual48x64 round diamond</h2><img src="diamond-48x64.png" alt="3072 actual round diamond elements"><p>3072 elements; provisional2.5mm pitch gives120x160mm;10% spares reserved per color. <a href="diamond-48x64.json">Exact local project</a>.</p></article></section><h2>Assembly and offline evidence</h2><p>The complete immutable grid determines every preview pixel, serpentine row/column step, material count, PDF chart and CSV. Saved progress and its undo use revision checks; two windows cannot silently overwrite each other. Manual cell changes create separate hashed variants with zero progress and preserve the original. JSON import keeps validated progress in a new local project. Browser storage and native Preferences remain separate from existing thread-art guides.</p><p>Small12x8 test projects deliberately use96 pieces for exhaustive browser and PDF assertions. Desktop/touch tests compare every cell-center RGB value and every CSV/PDF step, exercise offline PDF/JSON reload and edits, and refuse insufficient stock. Their6-page guides are test evidence, not a customer portrait quality benchmark.</p><p><a href="mosaic-desktop-guide.pdf">Exact96-piece mosaic guide</a> · <a href="diamond-desktop-guide.pdf">Exact96-piece diamond guide</a> · <a href="pdf-evidence.json">Independent PDF audit</a> · <a href="owner-evidence.json">Larger owner-photo evidence</a> · <a href="http://127.0.0.1:4183/">Website</a> · <a href="http://127.0.0.1:5183/output/pin-basis/report.html">Separate string-art quality experiment</a></p><p>Physical kit/color/spacing/adhesion/baseplate acceptance and current-build phone execution remain open. Baseplate planning, richer palette search, magnetic/style options and server commerce integration for these new engines are separate pending work. The full M0-M7 roadmap is not complete.</p></html>\n',encoding="utf-8")
